; Equity conversion postings alongside an explicit cost. hledger knows that
; the equity pair records the same exchange the cost does and leaves it out of
; the sum; SwiftLedger reads no meaning into an account name, so it sees the
; pair twice over and refuses the entry.
2026-01-01 Exchange, recorded both ways
    assets:eur                 100 EUR @@ 110 USD
    equity:conversion         -100 EUR
    equity:conversion          110 USD
    assets:usd                -110 USD
